[{"title":"北游诗二十一首 其六 大雨即事呈同事诸君","author":"张元凯","text":"浮槎千里逐浮萍，雷雨空江彻夜鸣。\n鹏鴳逍遥堪自失，龙蛇夭矫亦须惊。\n床头虹色芙蓉匣，海上鲸波骠骑营。\n舟楫商家元不乏，兔罝公等自干城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29177,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北游诗二十一首 其七 清郡与郑中伯夜坐","author":"张元凯","text":"短筇相过话灯前，屈指漂零第几年。\n落叶一庭霜满地，清笳万井月中天。\n孔融意气存张俭，杜甫交游老郑虔。\n何事倾尊不成醉，异乡头白各凄然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29178,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北游诗二十一首 其八 寄王和甫","author":"张元凯","text":"秋入船窗夜气凉，白云如雾湿衣裳。\n乱萤过水添星影，高树遮山逗月光。\n季子无金空作客，长卿多病且还乡。\n十年扣角心同苦，寄尔商歌怨更长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29179,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北游诗二十一首 其九 九日","author":"张元凯","text":"孤舟何处逢佳节，淮有三洲半草莱。\n乡国弟兄鸿雁信，客途风雨菊花杯。\n空囊自觉长安远，明镜何须短鬓催。\n却忆故园年少事，壶觞戏马月中回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29180,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北游诗二十一首 其十 送刘生","author":"张元凯","text":"边鸿朔雪年年见，漕檄军书日日闻。\n潦倒西游繻未弃，仓皇东走袂难分。\n获麟渡口飞黄叶，戏马台前起暮云。\n回首壮图消欲尽，可堪孤棹送刘蕡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29181,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北游诗二十一首 其十一 旅寓邻妇故倡也悉其平生偶述","author":"张元凯","text":"俨然高髻楚人妆，一曲新声总断肠。\n少弟蒙恩为协律，狂夫被遣出平羌。\n借来燕垒危难住，种得莲房老亦香。\n鸾镜晓临无限恨，且将心事问徐娘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29182,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北游诗二十一首 其十二 长安逢塞上班师友人有作漫和","author":"张元凯","text":"盛秋边骑若云屯，奏捷飞书入雁门。\n浪说单于刑白马，羞称公主嫁乌孙。\n班师节钺归三殿，款塞旌旗过五原。\n幕府献功方饮至，撰成铙曲侑金樽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29183,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北游诗二十一首 其十三 旅中逢故人饮","author":"张元凯","text":"关河冰雪滞征轮，邂逅穷交白发新。\n学剑学书吾少贱，种瓜种豆尔长贫。\n纵输黄鹄能遗世，尚赖青山不负人。\n岐路一樽何必尽，待归长醉五湖滨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29184,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北游诗二十一首 其十四 送李都尉出塞","author":"张元凯","text":"白马翩翩出羽林，陇西都尉二毛侵。\n剖符未得君王命，推毂先勤主帅心。\n朝散黄金酬死战，夕飞赤羽报生擒。\n匈奴已灭边烽息，无奈双龙夜夜吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29185,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北游诗二十一首 其十五 北河访客","author":"张元凯","text":"关河风浪雨冥冥，上濑搴裳过野亭。\n芳草尽遗三辅绿，断云常接太行青。\n酒人昨日逢燕市，贾客何时下洞庭。\n岐路一樽生感慨，望中明灭少微星。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29186,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北游诗二十一首 其十六 送客得友人书","author":"张元凯","text":"天涯芳草暮云横，握手青樽此日情。\n榻并南州徐孺子，书传东海鲁先生。\n花间宿雾常疑雨，树外平冈宛似城。\n楚地故人秦地别，古来踪迹本浮萍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29187,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北游诗二十一首 其十七 旅怀","author":"张元凯","text":"长安日日赋归欤，何事穷秋尚索居。\n和氏慢藏怀里璧，刘生误读枕中书。\n骨留燕市元非骏，铗动商歌不为鱼。\n朔雪陇云飞不尽，梦魂愁绝独驱车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29188,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北游诗二十一首 其十八 过淮","author":"张元凯","text":"羁栖鞅掌不堪论，日罄垆头酒一尊。\n淮府于今辞相国，楚宫聊复酹王孙。\n蘋花明月迎归棹，杨柳秋风过里门。\n渔父江潭如讯问，故园犹幸钓矶存。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29189,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北游诗二十一首 其十九 江上逢客遂为金焦之游","author":"张元凯","text":"旅泊因成汗漫游，淮南芳草遍汀洲。\n穷途不向青山泣，窜迹言寻白社投。\n一棹木兰江似带，半瓢竹叶月如钩。\n卜居未得从詹尹，避世真堪遇许由。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29190,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北游诗二十一首 其二十 泊舟","author":"张元凯","text":"高秋去国独兴哀，漂泊孤舟向水隈。\n云识山空朝不散，潮知河浅夜能来。\n微茫树影千帆落，迢递江声一雁回。\n贡禹鹖冠犹在首，王阳书札可曾开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29191,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北游诗二十一首 其二十一 还家","author":"张元凯","text":"十年憔悴一青袍，何事还家尚佩刀。\n故国凉风吹燕雀，高城落日下蓬蒿。\n空庐抱影无三窟，愁鬓经秋有二毛。\n最是生平耽绿酒，陈卿常谪是西曹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29192,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋居杂咏二十首 其一","author":"张元凯","text":"举头望白云，頫首看流水。\n古之东郭生，悟彼北宫子。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29193,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋居杂咏二十首 其二","author":"张元凯","text":"蕉鹿遗大野，木鸡在深林。\n山月直入室，松风与披襟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29194,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋居杂咏二十首 其三","author":"张元凯","text":"世及乘朱轮，赏延端章甫。\n稍曾事贵游，爰居听钟鼓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29195,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋居杂咏二十首 其四","author":"张元凯","text":"日暮临高台，心在归鸟边。\n明月出沧海，白云流青天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29196,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋居杂咏二十首 其五","author":"张元凯","text":"区中多畏涂，蹙蹙靡年载。\n方尔相呴濡，悠然问江海。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29197,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋居杂咏二十首 其六","author":"张元凯","text":"高鸟凌青汉，鼷鼠穴神丘。\n还将齐物意，且作逍遥游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29198,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋居杂咏二十首 其七","author":"张元凯","text":"再生宋人犊，复失塞翁马。\n天道诚悠悠，是难测识者。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29199,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋居杂咏二十首 其八","author":"张元凯","text":"颠越全于酒，困穷乐吾天。\n不材山之木，婆娑永其年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29200,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋居杂咏二十首 其九","author":"张元凯","text":"嘉树荫吾庐，凉风吹絺绤。\n久甘守太玄，莫与辩坚白。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29201,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋居杂咏二十首 其十","author":"张元凯","text":"乘杯不渡海，且注竹叶春。\n自是无心者，空为有发人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29202,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋居杂咏二十首 其十一","author":"张元凯","text":"三春秀紫芝，九秋飞黄鹄。\n川上忽坐忘，不闻虚舟触。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29203,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋居杂咏二十首 其十二","author":"张元凯","text":"幽栖巢林樾，时出濯沧浪。\n兴到呼李白，愁来命杜康。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29204,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋居杂咏二十首 其十三","author":"张元凯","text":"好学无闻焉，佳兵吾衰矣。\n且乐荣启期，不羡鲁施氏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29205,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋居杂咏二十首 其十四","author":"张元凯","text":"池中寒冰澌，原上春草生。\n用心如明镜，不将亦不迎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29206,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋居杂咏二十首 其十五","author":"张元凯","text":"清樽泛流霞，一室生虚白。\n鹓雏栖高梧，空以腐鼠嚇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29207,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋居杂咏二十首 其十六","author":"张元凯","text":"蓬蒿张仲宅，罗雀翟公门。\n五斗自带砺，八口聊饔飧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29208,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋居杂咏二十首 其十七","author":"张元凯","text":"智囊徒自役，垄断亦何有。\n临流无桔槔，吾慕汉阴叟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29209,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋居杂咏二十首 其十八","author":"张元凯","text":"绿水濯吾足，青山挂吾瓢。\n童子衣荷叶，柳下来承蜩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29210,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋居杂咏二十首 其十九","author":"张元凯","text":"草木鹑之居，朝夕鷇以食。\n嗤嗤四十年，梦梦如一息。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29211,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋居杂咏二十首 其二十","author":"张元凯","text":"雨湿藕花渚，风吹芙蓉裳。\n因看山梁雉，亡却沙丘羊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29212,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长安道四首 其一","author":"张元凯","text":"二月桃始华，千门柳初绿。\n饮酒青楼间，望见黄金屋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29213,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长安道四首 其二","author":"张元凯","text":"羽林期门儿，下直誇闾里。\n昨朝旄仗下，肃慎贡楛矢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29214,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长安道四首 其三","author":"张元凯","text":"朝出春明门，青山夹驰道。\n流水公子车，如茵王孙草。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29215,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长安道四首 其四","author":"张元凯","text":"年少霍家奴，横行紫骝马。\n道逢五侯来，扬鞭不肯下。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29216,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意四首 其一","author":"张元凯","text":"君从蓟北回，遗我轩辕镜。\n但照心异同，不照容衰盛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29217,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意四首 其二","author":"张元凯","text":"君从日南回，遗我双翡翠。\n口中衔明珠，疑是相思泪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29218,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意四首 其三","author":"张元凯","text":"君从荆土回，遗我连环玦。\n不渝坚贞心，难解绸缪结。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29219,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意四首 其四","author":"张元凯","text":"君从蜀江回，遗我一端锦。\n鸳鸯穿芙蕖，飞上合欢枕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29220,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大堤曲二首 其一","author":"张元凯","text":"女郎盈大堤，罗袖翻全疋。\n春风易醉人，俱作桃花色。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29221,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大堤曲二首 其二","author":"张元凯","text":"迎风乱云鬟，拾翠露纤手。\n兰桡柳下来，遥认卬之友。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29222,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春江花月夜二首 其一","author":"张元凯","text":"金卮湿花露，罗袖留春云。\n冶容月同皎，微词人莫闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29223,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春江花月夜二首 其二","author":"张元凯","text":"条风动芳树，素月流金波。\n阳春宋玉和，子夜秦青歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29224,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"相逢行二首 其一","author":"张元凯","text":"相逢游侠伴，大醉柳市南。\n季布止一诺，生平无二三。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29225,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"相逢行二首 其二","author":"张元凯","text":"相逢大堤上，美人花不如。\n却笑陈孟公，夜行藩其车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29226,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自君之出矣二首 其一","author":"张元凯","text":"自君之出矣，日日理乱丝。\n丝已织成绮，君归尚无期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29227,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自君之出矣二首 其二","author":"张元凯","text":"自君之出矣，夜夜望明河。\n河水隔牛女，不得常相过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29228,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青楼曲","author":"张元凯","text":"妾本长干籍，来住夫差城。\n巷多恶年少，不敢弹鸣筝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29229,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"少年行","author":"张元凯","text":"狐白解与人，黄金已孤注。\n独有双吴钩，未敢轻输去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29230,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"览镜二首 其一","author":"张元凯","text":"匣中有古镜，清光如明月。\n昔照我朱颜，今照我白发。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29231,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"览镜二首 其二","author":"张元凯","text":"白发生今年，绿酒且今夕。\n每有忧生嗟，岂为勋业惜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29232,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居二首 其一","author":"张元凯","text":"草阁抱明月，碧砌散流水。\n门掩鹿不来，风吹落松子。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29233,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居二首 其二","author":"张元凯","text":"披拂桃花风，独往孤云意。\n山中久忘言，寄客无文字。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29234,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过酒家二首 其一","author":"张元凯","text":"系马大道傍，独对高城坐。\n东风吹门开，门外乘轩过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29235,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过酒家二首 其二","author":"张元凯","text":"楚楚黄公垆，酒深不可揭。\n昨醉阮嗣宗，今醉毕茂世。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29236,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江楼二首 其一","author":"张元凯","text":"绿窗开云中，青壁凌江沚。\n髣髴翡翠屏，照耀明光绮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29237,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江楼二首 其二","author":"张元凯","text":"江帆留不住，美人在天涯。\n高楼日暮心，肠断芙蓉花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29238,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"独坐","author":"张元凯","text":"孤亭散玄草，独坐对青樽。\n啼鸟留在径，落花飞出门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29239,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春","author":"张元凯","text":"吾适点也志，暮春春服成。\n迟回绿柳下，载听黄鸟鸣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29240,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留客","author":"张元凯","text":"对客共小饮，阅世成大噱。\n且啖景升牛，莫舞羊公鹤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29241,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜","author":"张元凯","text":"秋深未除架，庭草凄以多。\n凉风忽吹堕，蜻蛚与飞蛾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29242,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江亭夜月送客二首 其一","author":"张元凯","text":"月出大江白，山近高城青。\n我归掩蓬荜，君去逐浮萍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29243,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江亭夜月送客二首 其二","author":"张元凯","text":"津亭黯然别，芦苇风萧萧。\n舟中有明月，庶几慰寂寥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29244,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴趋谣十二首 其一","author":"张元凯","text":"旭日照金阊，九衢散晴绮。\n绣縠雕盘餐，佻佻贾人子。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29245,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴趋谣十二首 其二","author":"张元凯","text":"醵饮市珍羞，主进要王谢。\n千钱坐堂上，不满坐堂下。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29246,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴趋谣十二首 其三","author":"张元凯","text":"夫婿咸阳商，家住阊门右。\n千金买明珠，照耀翡翠首。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29247,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴趋谣十二首 其四","author":"张元凯","text":"吾土本清嘉，月旦近嚣嚣。\n贩夫弄文墨，竖子赓歌谣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29248,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴趋谣十二首 其五","author":"张元凯","text":"少妇颜如花，居肆日中贸。\n金钱投锦囊，牙筹笼翠袖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29249,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴趋谣十二首 其六","author":"张元凯","text":"吴儿织吴锦，新机索高价。\n绚綵画不成，俨然夺造化。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29250,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴趋谣十二首 其七","author":"张元凯","text":"来往伯通桥，生长泰伯里。\n贫贱人弃焉，富贵骄人耳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29251,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴趋谣十二首 其八","author":"张元凯","text":"绮幔碧油航，士女炫新妆。\n拾翠青山侧，采芳绿水傍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29252,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴趋谣十二首 其九","author":"张元凯","text":"士卒筹米盐，卫尉羁文法。\n巷有专诸墓，里无干将匣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29253,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]